OL,5,G1200 Traffic Cops                      
OL,6,     FAround 3000 people a year are     
OL,7,     Fkilled or seriously injured       
OL,8,     Fbecause of drink driving. In this 
OL,9,     Fepisode, officers launch a drink  
OL,10,     Fand drug driving crackdown and    
OL,11,     Fmake about 200 arrests.           
OL,12,G1300 Traffic Cops                      
OL,13,     FA look at how solo officers are   
OL,14,     Fmore likely to suffer an injury   
OL,15,     Fthan when working in pairs. A     
OL,16,     Froutine stop on a car suspected of
OL,17,     Fhaving no MOT attracts the        
OL,18,     Finterest of an armed man.         
